## How to ask for a change

The goal of this setup is that a request like *"remove the header on the bookings table screen"* turns into a correct pull request without a hand-holding session. That works when the request carries four things:

```
Goal: <one sentence — what changes for the user>
Where: @path/to/file-or-folder (or the screen / endpoint / entity name from the table above)
Acceptance criteria:
  - Given <state>, when <action>, then <observable result>
  - …
Out of scope: <what must NOT change>
```

Tasks without acceptance criteria are not eligible for automatic PRs (see docs/agent-safe-tasks.md). Vague words ("improve", "clean up", "make it nicer") are a request for a proposal, not for code.

